{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>But to the sons of Kohath he did not give, for the service of the holy things was upon them.</b> Not the service of the Tent, but the service of the Sanctuary. Now the blessed El said concerning the wagons that they were for the service of the Tent of Meeting — that being the burden of the sons of Gershon and the sons of Merari. But in the burden of the sons of Kohath there was nothing at all of the structure of the Tent of Meeting; rather, their burden was the holy vessels that were inside it, which are called Sanctuary, as it says: וְנָסְעוּ הַקְּהָתִים נֹשְׂאֵי הַמִּקְדָּשׁ (Numbers 10:21)."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:53.822750796Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}